 "line_starts_vs_grid": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 5.538,
   "text": "你家菜刀，沾水不擦就会锈。 / 这把剑埋了两千多年，还是[亮]的。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": -0.123,
   "grid_bar": -1,
   "beat": 4,
   "delta": -0.123
  },
  {
   "start": 5.538,
   "end": 9.5,
   "text": "主人，是卧薪尝胆的越王勾践。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 5.538,
   "grid_bar": 2,
   "beat": 2,
   "delta": -0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 11.764,
   "end": 16.293,
   "text": "如今它在湖北省博物馆， / 有一间自己的独立展厅。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 11.764,
   "grid_bar": 5,
   "beat": 1,
   "delta": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 16.293,
   "end": 20.821,
   "text": "有一种流传很广的说法： / 它表面[镀了铬]，所以不锈。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 16.293,
   "grid_bar": 7,
   "beat": 1,
   "delta": -0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 20.821,
   "end": 24.217,
   "text": "是不是真的？先回到它出土那天。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 20.821,
   "grid_bar": 9,
   "beat": 1,
   "delta": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 24.217,
   "end": 28.746,
   "text": "1965年冬，湖北江陵， / 修水渠时，挖出一片楚墓。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 24.217,
   "grid_bar": 10,
   "beat": 3,
   "delta": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 28.746,
   "end": 33.274,
   "text": "其中一座，深[10.8米]， / 用夯土和白膏泥层层封住。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 28.746,
   "grid_bar": 12,
   "beat": 3,
   "delta": -0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 33.274,
   "end": 36.104,
   "text": "两千多年，从没被盗过。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 33.274,
   "grid_bar": 14,
   "beat": 3,
   "delta": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 36.104,
   "end": 38.935,
   "text": "木椁里，套着两层棺。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 36.104,
   "grid_bar": 15,
   "beat": 4,
   "delta": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 38.935,
   "end": 43.463,
   "text": "内棺里，墓主人左边， / 一把剑插在黑漆鞘里。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 38.935,
   "grid_bar": 17,
   "beat": 1,
   "delta": -0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 43.463,
   "end": 47.425,
   "text": "洗净剑鞘，拔出来： / 寒光闪闪。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 43.463,
   "grid_bar": 19,
   "beat": 1,
   "delta": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 47.425,
   "end": 51.954,
   "text": "越王鸠浅，自作用剑。 / {越王\"鸠浅\"，为自己做的剑}",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 47.425,
   "grid_bar": 20,
   "beat": 4,
   "delta": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 51.954,
   "end": 56.482,
   "text": "十几位学者，写了40多封信， / 才认定：鸠浅，就是勾践。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 51.954,
   "grid_bar": 22,
   "beat": 4,
   "delta": -0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 56.482,
   "end": 61.577,
   "text": "1977年拍科教片，拿它试过： / 30多张纸，一下划破20多张。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 56.482,
   "grid_bar": 24,
   "beat": 4,
   "delta": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 61.577,
   "end": 66.105,
   "text": "不锈的原因之一，是[料好]： / 含锡约18–20%，铅几乎为零。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 61.577,
   "grid_bar": 27,
   "beat": 1,
   "delta": -0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 66.105,
   "end": 70.633,
   "text": "镀铬？博物馆研究了7年多， / 结论是：菱形花纹，热镀[锡]。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 66.105,
   "grid_bar": 29,
   "beat": 1,
   "delta": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 70.633,
   "end": 74.412,
   "text": "那它，到底为什么不锈？",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 70.633,
   "grid_bar": 31,
   "beat": 1,
   "delta": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 75.162,
   "end": 77.992,
   "text": "其实，它也[锈]了。",
